# ============================================================
# EXPERIMENT 5
# ORIGINAL V6 + LOCAL STEM
#
# Research question:
#
# Original V6:
#
#   Input 720×720
#       ↓
#   Conv 7×7, stride 2
#       ↓
#   360×360
#       ↓
#   Layer1
#
#
# Experiment 5:
#
#   Input 720×720
#       ↓
#   Conv 3×3, stride 1
#       ↓
#   720×720
#       ↓
#   Layer1 Block 1 Conv1, stride 2
#       ↓
#   360×360
#
#
# 目的：
#
# 先在 full-resolution genotype image
# 做一次 local feature extraction，
# 再進行第一次 downsampling。
#
#
# 保持不變：
#
# - channels = 64 / 128 / 256 / 512
# - GroupNorm
# - No initial MaxPool
# - BasicBlock = [2,2,2,2]
# - Global Average Pooling
# - Dropout = 0.5
# - Weighted BCE
# - pos_weight = 2.0
# - AdamW
# - LR = 5e-5
# - Weight decay = 1e-3
# - Batch size = 2
# - Max epochs = 30
# - Early stopping patience = 5
# - ReduceLROnPlateau
# - EXACT SAME Exp1 5×5 repeated CV folds
# - EXACT SAME Exp1 seeds
#
# Outer Test30 is NOT used.
# ============================================================


